00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:58,720
But if I compare that to running a dishwasher, I have to load it, add soap, and run a cycle.

193
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:03,500
Setting up the dishwasher takes 20 minutes, whether there are five plates or 50.

