00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:05,020
Because that's a block operation.

195
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:05,600
Exactly.

196
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:06,740
It's a block operation.

197
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:15,280
The original report is essentially bragging that washing a single plate by hand is fundamentally faster than running a 50 plate dishwasher cycle,

198
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:20,180
simply because they changed the unit of measurement from the whole pile to a single plate.

